he arrowhead is displayed, not the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrow stem. The smufl attribute distinguishes different SMuFL glyphs that have an arrow appearance such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrowBlackUp, guitarStrumUp, or handbellsSwingUp. The specified glyph should match the descriptive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representation.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLArrow","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLArrow"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLArrow","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarrow","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArrow"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLArrow/color":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarrow\/color","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArrow\/color","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"title":"color","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"abstract":[{"text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"}}}